onomy/money/2025/05/15/F6N6Y6V2G4TQUAGADZB5XJP6HU/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘땅 위의 태양’ 핵융합발전소 개발 경쟁… 美·中, 누가 먼저 상용화할까","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-14T15:36:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2025/05/15/CETFXCKCC5AS3DNBVSQXKGPC3E/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"GM·LG엔솔 공동개발… 차세대 ‘LMR 배터리’ 2028년 美서 본격 양산","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-14T15:33:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/auto/2025/05/15/JURHO4SUCNFHBP2BVO7PH2ZX7E/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"우주 쓰레기, 몇㎜짜리라도 충돌하면 치명적","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-14T15:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2025/05/15/OWNFQT333BHS3LP66Y6GAMYKWY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"“학생 때 美 원자로 갖고 실험했는데… 美에 원자로 수출, 감회 남달라”","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-14T15:36:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2025/05/15/SQCQSEYZSVGW7FSZ2O44J2RZYQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"경제","categories":["economy"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/economy/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘3년째 매각 무산’ 부실 MG손보, 결국 청산 절차 밟는다","partialText":"","date":"2025-05-14T15:31:00.000Z","url